# Layer Gate

Purpose:
  Layer-based L0–L4 quality and verification gate.
  Each layer completion is marked with a git tag for traceability.

Owns: testing\LAYER-GATE.sdd

## Layer Levels

Layers:
  L0: Backend (BE)
  L1: Frontend (FE)
  L2: Mobile (MD)
  L3: Integration
  L4: E2E / Production

## Gate Rules

Rules:
  - Each layer must pass its quality gate before advancing.
  - L0 → L1 requires Manual QA Gate completion (hash verification).
  - Layer completion triggers a git tag.

## Git Tag Format

Tag_Format: [layer]-[module]-[case]-L[level]-[date]
Example: be-payment-escrow-L0-20260818

## Tag Creation

Create_Tag:
  Trigger: Layer gate passed
  Command: git tag {tag_format}
  Push: git push origin {tag_format}

## Traceability

Purpose:
  Operator can checkout or create mini-development from any layer tag.
  Provides stable, revertible points in code history.

State: +
